  "title": "Q095 퀴즈 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Backup objects are retrieved immediately a few times per year and must survive the loss of one AZ. Which storage class is suitable?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 095</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>95 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"95번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:88%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q095\" data-question=\"Q095\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q095</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Backup objects are retrieved immediately a few times per year and must survive the loss of one AZ. Which storage class is suitable?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Standard-IA</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-standard-ia\">Standard-IA</a>는 드문 접근이지만 빠른 조회가 가능하며 다중 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 저장을 제공한다. 최소 기간·검색 비용도 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">이전 문제 <b>Q094</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q096/\">다음 문제 <b>Q096</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
